     F* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     F*           F I L E              S P E C I F I C A T I O N S
     F* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     FTBLFLD  IF  E           K        DISK
     FTBLFLDL1IF  E           K        DISK
     F            RTBLFLD                           KRENAMEFLDL1
     I* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     I*           I N P U T            S P E C I F I C A T I O N S
     I* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     I           SDS
     I*           PROGRAM DATA STRUCTURE
     I                                     *PROGRAM QPROG                 Screen
     I                                     *PARMS   QPARMS                Number
     I                                      244 253 QJOBN                 System
     I                                      254 263 QUSER                 System
     C* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     C*  I N I T I A L I Z A T I O N
     C* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     C           *ENTRY    PLIST
     C                     PARM           TBLNAM            6
     C                     PARM           TBLVAL            6
     C                     PARM           TBLDSC            35
     C                     PARM           TBGOOD  1         GOOD, Y/N
     C*
     C*   EXIT IF NO PARMS
     C*
     C           QPARMS    IFLT 4
     C                     EXSR EXIT
     C                     END
     C* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     C* M A I N L I N E
     C* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     C                     EXSR EDTVAL
     C*
     C                     EXSR EXIT
     C* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     C* S U B R O U T I N E S
     C* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     C* EDTVAL   EDIT VALUES
     C* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     C           EDTVAL    BEGSR
     C*
     C                     MOVE *BLANKS   TBLDSC
     C                     MOVE 'Y'       TBLDEF
     C*
     C* IF THE INPUTTED TBLVAL IS BLANK, AND THERE IS A DEFAULT,
     C* RETURN IT, ALONG WITH A POSITIVE RESPONSE.
     C*    ELSE
     C* IF TBLVAL IS BLANK OR NOT IN THE FILE, RETURN
     C* WITH A NEGATIVE RESPONSE.
     C*
     C           TBLVAL    IFEQ *BLANK
     C           KEYDEF    CHAINTBLFLDL1             99
     C           *IN99     IFEQ '0'
     C                     MOVE 'Y'       TBGOOD
     C                     ELSE
     C                     MOVE 'N'       TBGOOD
     C                     END
     C                     ELSE
     C           KEYTAB    CHAINTBLFLD               99
     C           *IN99     IFEQ '0'
     C                     MOVE 'Y'       TBGOOD
     C                     ELSE
     C                     MOVE 'N'       TBGOOD
     C                     END
     C                     END
     C*
     C                     ENDSR
     C* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     C* EXIT     END PROGRAM ROUTINE
     C* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     C           EXIT      BEGSR
     C*
     C                     SETON                     LR
     C                     RETRN
     C*
     C           EXITZ     ENDSR
     C* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     C* DEFINE   DEFINE FILE KEYS AND SYNONYMS
     C* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     C           DEFINE    BEGSR
     C*
     C           KEYTAB    KLIST
     C                     KFLD           TBLNAM
     C                     KFLD           TBLVAL
     C*
     C           KEYDEF    KLIST
     C                     KFLD           TBLNAM
     C                     KFLD           TBLDEF
     C*
     C                     ENDSR